WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.042
Row number assigns a unique sequence even when values tie.

00:00:04.042 --> 00:00:09.932
This makes it useful for selecting exactly the top two or top three rows per group.

00:00:09.932 --> 00:00:17.587
But if salaries tie and you only order by salary, the sequence among tied rows may not be deterministic.

00:00:17.587 --> 00:00:22.917
Add a stable tie-breaker such as employee I D when the order matters.
